                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">The Convergence of Physical & Digital Logistics</h3>
                    <p>
                        Modern logistics is no longer just about diesel, shipping containers, and manual warehousing. Today’s global supply chain operates as a hyper-connected, just-in-time digital ecosystem governed by Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP) systems, Transportation Management Systems (TMS), Warehouse Management Systems (WMS), and thousands of Industrial IoT (IIoT) sensors.
