                            </div>

                            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                                In this exemplar scenario based on major MOVEit and SolarWinds software compromises, a zero-day vulnerability was exploited in a widely used third-party Managed File Transfer (MFT) application deployed across global 3PLs and logistics integrators. Threat actors injected malicious code into automated file exchanges used for custom clearance documents, Bills of Lading (BoL), and inventory manifests.
                            </p>

                            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-4">
